data.definition:
The blockface template's numbers, step 9 at 0.15 mm, from its saved products only, beside step 8's record (bf_template_metrics_d2b, at 0.25 mm):
  members: 11 brains (photographed at every section, with few interpolated sections and even lighting), 22 blockface inputs (each brain and its mirror image), no b0-only member;
  brain = the template's brain mask (P >= 0.5); photographed = brain & photographed fraction >= 0.5 (the real mask);
  synthesized (the paper's "predicted") = brain & photographed fraction < 0.5, the rule of step 8's synthesized mask; also brain & photographed fraction = 0;
  symmetry: max |V - mirror(V)| of the gray, color, brain mask and real mask (exact 0 expected);
  the same in the MRI template's frame (through the template link, at 0.25 mm), for information.
